search for an apach mit licens altern pdf parser after the task wa reopen when the replac parser turn out to be agpl licens\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9703e908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"id\": \"944c8567f386bf1b\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2623076136501472, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.05237216235735318, \"vector_similarity\": 0.752157, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9703e908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1155, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:35\", \"token_count\": 555, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-61\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Async Batch I/O Race\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-25\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-25 10:20] Diana**: Blocker on the async batch path. Under concurrent load the workers hit an I/O race and throughput drops — roughly 10% versus the sync baseline.\\n\\n**[2026-08-25 10:21] Bob**: Is that the scheduler shell or the workers we just added?\\n\\n**[2026-08-25 10:23] Diana**: The workers. Scheduler alone was fine; once concurrent workers share I/O with the existing multi-thread batch pool, the race shows up.\\n\\n**[2026-08-25 11:48] Charlie**: That pool is the multi-thread path. Mixing it with async workers without coordinating I/O was going to bite us.\\n\\n**[2026-08-25 12:50] Alice**: Then we stop here. I have to leave the async batch work blocked until the race with the multi-thread pool is sorted. A 10% hit is not shippable.\\n\\n**[2026-08-25 12:51] Bob**: Ok.\\n\\n**[2026-08-25 12:52] Bob**: Fair. I'll hold further async work until we understand the interaction with that pool.\\n\\n**[2026-08-25 12:54] Diana**: I'll capture the repro steps so we can re-run once there's a candidate fix.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 61 slack thread async batch i o race channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 25 2026 08 25 10 20 diana blocker on the async batch path under concurr load the worker hit an i o race and throughput drop rough 10 versus the sync baselin 2026 08 25 10 21 bob is that the schedul shell or the worker we just ad 2026 08 25 10 23 diana the worker schedul alon wa fine onc concurr worker share i o with the exist multi thread batch pool the race show up 2026 08 25 11 48 charli that pool is the multi thread path mix it with async worker without coordin i o wa go to bite u 2026 08 25 12 50 alic then we stop here i have to leav the async batch work block until the race with the multi thread pool is sort a 10 hit is not shippabl 2026 08 25 12 51 bob ok 2026 08 25 12 52 bob fair i ll hold further async work until we understand the interact with that pool 2026 08 25 12 54 diana i ll captur the repro step so we can re run onc there s a candid fix\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e92db1c48a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-25-async-batch-io-race.md\", \"id\": \"a9c09e16686f535a\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2617870416501472, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.052372162357353175, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75042176, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-25-async-batch-io-race