{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"tl-v1","tool":"ragflow_retrieval","arguments":{"dataset_ids":["d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37"],"metadata_condition":{"logic":"and","conditions":[{"name":"path","comparison_operator":"is","value":"sources"}]},"page_size":10,"vector_similarity_weight":0.3,"similarity_threshold":0.2,"top_k":1024,"keyword":false,"question":"CIPH-47 blocked root cause multi-threading work internal"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"chunks\": [{\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-47\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Title**: Async job scheduler for concurrent batch API work\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-18\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAdd an asynchronous job scheduler to the batch API for higher throughput under concurrent load. Async workers were added, but a concurrent I/O race was found to cut throughput by roughly 10%; the task is blocked, depending on the multi-threading work.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-47\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Title**: Async job scheduler for concurrent batch API work\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-18\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Async job scheduler processes batch API jobs concurrently without a throughput regression.\\n\\n- Concurrent I/O race condition is resolved (currently the blocking issue).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-47\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Title**: Async job scheduler for concurrent batch API work\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-18\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAdd an asynchronous job scheduler to the batch API for higher throughput under concurrent load. Async workers were added, but a concurrent I/O race was found to cut t