with target text across multi-page PDFs (WS-01). Debugging traced the drift to a whitespace-handling issue that is blocked on upstream `pdfminer.six` issue/PR #992, which remains unmerged. Maintaining a local fork of the fix was evaluated and rejected due to long-term maintenance risk. The team has decided to leave this task Blocked pending an upstream merge, with no local workaround adopted.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-17\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-17\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-17\\n\\n**Title**: Fix Coordinate/Offset Drift in Multi-Page PDFs\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-19\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Coordinate drift root cause confirmed (whitespace handling in `pdfminer.six`).\\n\\n- Upstream `pdfminer.six` PR #992 merges, or an accepted local remediation is adopted (neither has occurred; task remains Blocked).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-17\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-17\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-17\\n\\n**Title**: Fix Coordinate/Offset Drift in Multi-Page PDFs\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-19\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nInvestigate and fix a coordinate/offset drift where redaction masks do not line up with target text across multi-page PDFs (WS-01). Debugging traced the drift to a whitespace-handling issue that is blocked on upstream `pdfminer.six` issue/PR #992, which remains unmerged. Maintaining a local fork of the fix was evaluated and rejected due to long-term maintenance risk. The team has decided to leave this task Blocked pending an upstream merge, with no local workaround adopted.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-17\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-17\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-17\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 17 sourc id src cu ciph 17 task id ciph 17 titl fix coordin offset drift in multi page pdfs status block assigne charli prioriti high date creat 2026 06 19 descript investig and fix a coord