Bob**: Building the local auth mock for air-gap testing so we can exercise Diana's key-rotation design without a real deployment.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 09:16] Bob**: Mock is up. It runs the rotation flow with the network disabled, same as a real air-gapped site would see.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 10:27] Diana**: Good, that's exactly what I need to validate the design against.\\n\\n**[2026-08-05 08:36] Alice**: How'd it go?\\n\\n**[2026-08-05 08:45] Bob**: Not great. Key rotation just can't complete with the network down — the flow we designed assumes at least a brief connection to finish the handshake.\\n\\n**[2026-08-05 08:48] Alice**: Ugh.\\n\\n**[2026-08-05 09:13] Diana**: So we're blocked. There's no resolution yet on how to rotate without any network at all.\\n\\n**[2026-08-05 09:33] Alice**: Offline auth stays blocked. Let's regroup on whether the design needs to change or whether we relax the offline requirement.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 17 slack thread offlin auth mock and rotat block channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 08 04 last activ 2026 08 05 2026 08 04 09 14 bob build the local auth mock for air gap test so we can exercis diana s key rotat design without a real deploy 2026 08 04 09 16 bob mock is up it run the rotat flow with the network disabl same a a real air gap site would see 2026 08 04 10 27 diana good that s exact what i need to valid the design against 2026 08 05 08 36 alic how d it go 2026 08 05 08 45 bob not great key rotat just can t complet with the network down the flow we design assum at least a brief connect to finish the handshak 2026 08 05 08 48 alic ugh 2026 08 05 09 13 diana so we re block there s no resolut yet on how to rotat without ani network at all 2026 08 05 09 33 alic offlin auth stay block let s regroup on whether the design need to chang or whether we relax the offlin requir\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e8cb8e688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-offline-auth-mock-block.md\", \"id\": \"0d5f3fc5f1872d47\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.32327255661840265, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.12511482374057523, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7856406, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-offline-auth-mock-block.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e8cb8e688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-offline-auth-mock-block.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-offline-auth-mock-block.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1092, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:54\", \"token_count\": 340, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-16\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Offline Mode Authentication Design\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-02\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 11:14] Diana**: Starting on offline-mode auth design. If we're running air-gapped, we can't call home for license validation or user auth, so key rotation can't assume an always-on network either.\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 11:16] Alice**: Right — whatever we design has to keep working with no connection for extended stretches.\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 11:22] Diana**: I'm sketching a rotation flow built around a locally held key rather than one that needs a live call to rotate.\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 13:00] Alice**: How do we actually rotate it if the site is air-gapped?\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 14:24] Diana**: Still working that part out — that's the piece I'm least confident about. I'll have a first draft of the design by Wednesday.\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 14:27] Diana**: I'll loop in Bob onc