rkstat that stay offlin for an extend period ha not been valid yet that check is expect onc a local auth mock exist sourc id src gdoc 13 offlin mode authent key rotat design owner diana document key doc 2013 last updat 2026 08 02 constraint t019 must support authent for air gap deploy where an alway on network can not be assum status activ design stage\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9a21c808a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-02-Offline-Mode-Authentication-Review.md\", \"id\": \"88c510ac1d8be399\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.31189045222944684, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.10634760032778119, \"vector_similarity\": 0.79149044, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-02-Offline-Mode-Authentication-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9a21c808a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-02-Offline-Mode-Authentication-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-02-Offline-Mode-Authentication-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 650, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:53\", \"token_count\": 300, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild a reproducible offline test harness that denies network access, then execute a full batch run under it to validate the strict air-gapped claim, depending on the completed AES-256 encryption pipeline. The offline batch run completed and was signed off, with a noted 45-second remote licence-check hang recorded; this sign-off is preliminary only and is not a compliance certification.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Offline test harness reliably denies network access during a batch run.\\n\\n- Full batch executes successfully to completion under the harness with network blocked.\\n\\n- Sign-off explicitly notes it is preliminary and not a compliance certification, along with the observed licence-check hang.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild a reproducible offline test harness that denies network access, then execute a full batch run under it to validate the strict air-gapped claim, depending on the completed AES-256 encryption pipeline. The offline batch run completed and was signed off, with a noted 45-second remote licence-check hang recorded; this sign-off is preliminary only and is not a compliance certification.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-04**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 37 sourc id src cu ciph 37 task id ciph 37 titl valid batch run under a network den