ty\": 0.09383611805258515, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7640295, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e969dcb28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1365, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:41\", \"token_count\": 610, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \" - *Opened the task because the strict offline air-gapped mode must be testable.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-10**: Diana - Offline Sign-off (Completed)\\n\\n - *Signed off on the offline batch run, depending on the completed AES-256 encryption pipeline, noting a 45-second remote licence-check hang; sign-off recorded as preliminary only, not a compliance certification.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"open the task becaus the strict offlin air gap mode must be testabl 2026 08 10 diana offlin sign off complet sign off on the offlin batch run depend on the complet ae 256 encrypt pipelin note a 45 second remot licenc check hang sign off record a preliminari onli not a complianc certif\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e969dcb28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"id\": \"b6b76363ffc0abba\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2912453050441724, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08132463577738913, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7810602, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e969dcb28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1365, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:41\", \"token_count\": 610, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-32\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Offline Test Harness\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-06\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-06 09:05] Diana**: Building the offline harness for the air-gapped mode claim — network access denied at the OS level so we get a reproducible offline run instead of just trusting the binary not to phone home.\\n\\n**[2026-08-06 09:06] Alice**: Make sure to check startup specifically — if any check blocks waiting on the network before it gives up, that's a problem even if everything after it runs fine offline.\\n\\n**[2026-08-06 09:32] Diana**: That's on the list. I want to see it fail closed fast, not hang.\\n\\n**[2026-08-06 09:43] Bob**: How does this interact with the offline auth work? If the license check can't reach anything, does it fail open or just error out?\\n\\n**[2026-08-06 09:46] Diana**: I'll run that combination through the harness too once the base setup is solid — good thing to catch here rather than in the field.\\n\\n**[2026-08-06 12:16] Evan**: Let me know when it's ready. I want to run the benchmark scripts through it too, once we have real offline numbers to compare against online.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 32 slack thread offlin test har channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 06 2026 08 06 09 05 diana build the offlin har for the air gap mode claim network access deni at the o level so we get a reproduc offlin run instead of just trust the binari not to phone home 2026 08 06 09 06 alic make sure to check startup specif if ani check block wait on the network befor it give up that s a problem even if everyth after it run fine offlin 2026 08 06 09 32 diana that s on the list i want to see it fail close fast not hang 2026 08 06 09 43 bob how doe this interact with the offlin auth work if the licens check can t reach anyth doe it fail open or just error out 2026 08 06 09 46 diana i ll run that combin through the har too onc the base setup is solid good thing to catch here rather than in the field 2026 08 06 12 16 evan let me know when it s readi i want to run the benchmark script through it too onc we have real offlin number to compar against onlin\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e8d113428a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-06-offline-harness.md\", \"id\": \"de1b508952a4dcdb\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2887471626368096, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.09383611805258515, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7435396, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-06-offline-harness.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e8d113428a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-06-offline-harness.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-06-offline-harness.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1135, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:51\", \"token_count\": 322, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-47\\n\\n# Sign-off Note: Offline Batch Run (Preliminary)\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2047\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-10\\n\\n## What Was Run\\n\\nA full batch redaction run was executed under the offline test harness (T027) with network access denied, using a local sample document set. The run depended on the completed AES-256 at-rest encryption pipeline (T021), since offline output still needs to be encrypted without any network-based key service.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-47\\n\\n# Sign-off Note: Offline Batch Run (Preliminary)\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2047\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-10\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nThe batch completed successfully end-to-end with the network denied: no network-dependent call blocked the run, and local policy parsing worked entirely from bundled definitions.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-47\\n\\n# Sign-off Note: Offline Batch Run (Preliminary)\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2047\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-10\\n\\n## Noted Issue: 45-Second Licence-Check Hang\\n\\nThe run was not clean — the HTTP client attempted to verify the license key against a remote server before timing out and falling back to the cached local license, adding roughly 45 seconds of startup delay. This is logged as a known issue, not something this sign-off waives.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-47\\n\\n# Sign-off Note: Offline Batch Run (Preliminary)\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2047\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-10\\n\\n## Scope of This Sign-off\\n\\nThis sign-off is **preliminary** and covers functional completion of a batch run offline only. It is explicitly **not** a compliance certification — it does not cover side-channel analysis, physical security, or any regulatory attestation. No patient records or clinical data were used in this test run.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 47 sign off note offlin batch run preliminari owner diana document key doc 2047 last updat 2026 08 10 what wa run a full batch redact run wa execut under the offlin test har t027 with network access deni use a local sampl document set the run depend on the complet ae 256 at rest encrypt pipelin t021 sinc offlin output still need to be encrypt without ani network base key servic sourc id src gdoc 47 sign off note offlin batch run preliminari owner diana document key doc 2047 last updat 2026 08 10 result the batch complet success end to end with the network deni no network depend call block the run and local polici pars work entir from bundl definit sourc id src gdoc 47 sign off note offlin batch run preliminari owner diana document key doc 2047 last updat 2026 08 10 note issu 45 second licenc check hang the run wa not clean the http client attempt to verifi the licens key against a remot server befor time out and fall back to the cach local licens ad rough 45 second of startup delay this is log a a known issu not someth this sign off waif sourc id src gdoc 47 sign off note offlin batch run preliminari owner diana document key doc 2047 last updat 2026 08 10 scope of this sign off this sign off is preliminari and cover function complet of a batch run offlin onli it is explicit not a complianc certif it doe not cover side channel analysi physic secur or ani regulatori attest no patient record or clinic data were use in this test run\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9b0c0dc8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-10-Air-Gapped-Mode-Offline-Signoff.md\", \"id\": \"5b05fa1d83b734fd\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.27910452404417235, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08132463577738913, \"vector_similarity\": 0.74059093, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-10-Air-Gapped-Mode-Offline-Signoff.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9b0c0dc8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-10-Air-Gapped-Mode-Offline-Signoff.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-10-Air-Gapped-Mode-Offline-Signoff.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1322, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:40\", \"token_count\": 456, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-46\\n\\n# Design Note: Reproducible Offline Test Harness\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2046\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-06\\n\\n## Why a Harness, Not a One-Off VM\\n\\nAn earlier air-gapped check (see the manual single-VM USB-transfer test) proved the CLI *can* run offline, but it wasn't repeatable — every run required hand-configuring a disconnected machine. T027 calls for a harness that reliably and automatically denies network access on every run, so the offline claim can be re-verified continuously rather than checked once by hand.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-46\\n\\n# Design Note: Reproducible Offline Test Harness\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2046\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-06\\n\\n## Harness Design\\n\\n- Runs the batch CLI inside a dedicated Linux network namespace (`ip netns`) with no interfaces attached except loopback, rather than relying on a physically air-gapped machine.\\n\\n- A wrapper script asserts the namespace has zero routable interfaces before invoking the CLI, and fails the harness run outright — rather than silently proceeding — if any route to the outside world is detected.\\n\\n- Harness output is a pass/fail plus a captured syscall-level network-attempt log, so any code path that *tries* to reach the network, even if it degrades gracefully, is visible for follow-up.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-46\\n\\n# Design Note: Reproducible Offline Test Harness\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2046\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-06\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nDenies network access reliably and repeatably across local test runs. The harness is not yet wired into CI (it currently runs manually), and it validates network denial only — it does not itself certify the full offline batch run for compliance purposes; that sign-off is a separate step.\\n\\n*Status*: Active. Harness reliably enforces network denial; CI integration and any compliance certification are separate, not-yet-complete steps.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 46 design note reproduc offlin test har owner diana document key doc 2046 last updat 2026 08 06 whi a har not a one off vm an earlier air gap check see the manual singl vm usb transfer test prove the cli can run offlin but it wasn t repeat everi run requir hand configur a disconnect machin t027 call for a har that reliabl and automat deni network access on everi run so the offlin claim can be re verifi continu rather than check onc by hand sourc id src gdoc 46 design note reproduc offlin test har owner diana document key doc 2046 last updat 2026 08 06 har design run the batch cli insid a dedic linux network namespac ip netn with no interfac attach except loopback rather than reli on a physic air gap machin a wrapper script assert the namespac ha zero routabl interfac befor invok the cli and fail the har run outright rather than silent proceed if ani rout to the outsid world is detect har output is a pas fail plus a captur syscal level network attempt log so ani code path that tri to reach the network even if it degrad grace is visibl for follow up sourc id src gdoc 46 design note reproduc offlin test har owner diana document key doc 2046 last updat 2026 08 06 status deni network access reliabl and repeat across local test run the har is not yet wire into ci it current run manual and it valid network denial onli it doe not itself certifi the full offlin batch run for complianc purpos that sign off is a separ step status activ har reliabl enforc network denial ci integr and ani complianc certif are separ not yet complet step\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9d8406c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-06-Air-Gapped-Mode-Harness-Design.md\", \"id\": \"26a2e97fa1bb8b9c\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.27548201504417236, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08132463577738913, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7285159, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-06-Air-Gapped-Mode-Harness-Design.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9d8406c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-06-Air-Gapped-Mode-Harness-Design.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-06-Air-Gapped-Mode-Harness-Design.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1618, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:07\", \"token_count\": 465, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-21\\n\\n# Test Note: Air-Gapped Mode Execution\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2021\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-06\\n\\n## Isolated Test Setup\\n\\nTo simulate a strictly offline deployment, we deployed the CLI on a fresh Ubuntu 22.04 VM with the virtual network adapter explicitly disabled (no loopback to host, no NAT). We transferred the application bundle and a 200-document test corpus via a simulated USB mount.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-21\\n\\n# Test Note: Air-Gapped Mode Execution\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2021\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-06\\n\\n## What Worked\\n\\n- The core regex engine and OCR pipeline initialized perfectly without attempting to phone home for license verification or telemetry updates.\\n\\n- The local TPM-based volume encryption successfully mounted the temporary storage drives using the pre-seeded hardware key.\\n\\n- Redaction throughput remained identical to the networked baseline.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-21\\n\\n# Test Note: Air-Gapped Mode Execution\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2021\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-06\\n\\n## Test Limitation\\n\\nThis run built and smoke-tested the harness itself; it did not yet execute a full batch to completion or produce a sign-off. That full run — depending on the already-completed AES-256 encryption pipeline — is the next step and is not reported on here.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 21 test note air gap mode execut owner diana document key doc 2021 last updat 2026 08 06 isol test setup to simul a strict offlin deploy we deploy the cli on a fresh ubuntu 22 04 vm with the virtual network adapt explicit disabl no loopback to host no nat we transfer the applic bundl and a 200 document test corpus via a simul usb mount sourc id src gdoc 21 test note air gap mode execut owner diana document key doc 2021 last updat 2026 08 06 what work the core regex engin and ocr pipelin initi perfect without attempt to phone home for licens verif or telemetri updat the local tpm base volum encrypt success mount the temporari storag drive use the pre seed hardwar key redact throughput remain ident to the network baselin sourc id src gdoc 21 test note air gap mode execut owner diana document key doc 2021 last updat 2026 08 06 test limit this run built and smoke test the har itself it did not yet execut a full batch to complet or produc a sign off that full run depend on the alreadi complet ae 256 encrypt pipelin is the next step and is not report on here\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9bf73208a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-06-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing-Review.md\", \"id\": \"